{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月10日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261110.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】政府早前就修訂《建築物管理條例》展開公眾諮詢，顯示對授權票設上限有保留，或研究以電子授權方式操作，當中有甚麼考慮？</p><p>周二《時事全方位》，請來民政事務總署署長探討。</p><p>題目：修訂建築物管理條例</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:33:28.142028+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T12:05:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.088592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T12:27:29.358075+00:00","content_hash":"50257b913e2d5b2b91004a8b9aa1bda24b238e7f6ab89609b8e8e60b4d5e2427","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:33:28.142028+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}